{"at": "2026-10-17T07:33:33.385562+00:00", "event_id": "01M54CFGJ91EEZ0QNT3D26PSJ0", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M54CFGJ91EEZ0QNT3D26PSHZ", "input_key": "not_applicable_handling", "mission_id": "01M54C8D8DFHPVPNCCZTJ25S67", "mission_slug": "subtask-skipped-status-01M54C8D", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["alias-normalize-to-skipped", "distinct-persisted-value", "reject-strict"], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "Should the events package persist 'not_applicable' as a distinct subtask value, or treat it as an input alias for 'skipped'?", "recorded_at": "2026-10-17T07:33:33.385562Z", "run_id": "01M54CFGJ91EEZ0QNT3D26PSHZ", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-17T07:33:33.385019Z", "step_id": "specify.subtask-status.not-applicable-alias"}}
{"at": "2026-10-17T07:33:35.044509+00:00", "event_id": "01M54CFJ64RQPSDTAMRPZG9XP0", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M54CFGJ91EEZ0QNT3D26PSHZ", "final_answer": "Accept 'not_applicable' on input as an alias and normalize it to 'skipped'; never persist it as a distinct value (serialization emits 'skipped'). Rationale: the CLI (spec-kitty#5953) and the shipped producer-contract schema both treat 'not_applicable' as an alias for 'skipped' with no distinct persisted meaning (the schema subtasks enum contains 'skipped', not 'not_applicable'). Defensive input acceptance avoids a crash on a stray unresolved alias while keeping the canonical/persisted surface aligned with the source-of-truth schema.", "mission_id": "01M54C8D8DFHPVPNCCZTJ25S67", "mission_slug": "subtask-skipped-status-01M54C8D", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-17T07:33:35.044509Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M54CFGJ91EEZ0QNT3D26PSHZ", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-17T07:33:35.043847Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
